WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:02.950
Please save my mother!

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.830
She's had a fever for so long 
and she's in so much pain!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.160
Please, save her, Father!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.530
Stay away from me, slave!

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.860
You filthy insect!

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.050
She's just the bastard child of a mistress.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.210
Teach her her place.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.000
Make her understand that she's a slave.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.420
I'm sorry, Mother. I couldn't 
get us any food today.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.660
But we still have that 
bread from two days ago.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:39.050
Mom?

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:41.810
Mom!

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.050
Mom...

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.130
Lapis...

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:02.070
The technology of alchemy exists to fix 
a world controlled by others...

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.830
I'm so bored!

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:53.610
<b>Little Red Singing Hood</b>

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:53.110
If Adam doesn't come for me soon,

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:57.100
maybe the boredom 
will crush me to death!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.650
<b>Episode 4
Golden Transmutation</b>

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.640
Maybe! Maybe!

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.440
Hey, where's Saint Germain?

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:06.290
Doing the final tuning on our Faust Robes.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:11.070
Thanks to the dancing Carol, 
we've made great progress.

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:12.160
All that's left...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.910
Where are you going?

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.580
Are you maybe, just maybe, 
trying to do this without us?

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:22.140
You can't wait until the 
Faust Robes are done?

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.810
It's no fun wearing a robe when you do it.

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.090
I want to pin them down and really feel it, 
with nothing in between us.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.520
Nothing in between you...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.440
Sounds like love!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.380
I want to feel Adam!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.890
I want him to pin me down and feel me!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.920
Groups 6 through 58, this way!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.570
Matsushiro, the place we're in now,

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:58.310
was chosen by Japan's high command 
as a backup headquarters.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:02.490
The predecessor of S.O.N.G., 
the unofficial organization known as

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:05.050
the Kazanari Organization, 
was stationed here, as well.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.220
The Kazanari Organization?

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:12.490
Japan, a nation poor in research and materials,
needed a way to turn the tide of the war.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:16.100
I'm told they started looking 
into the relics very early.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.020
And the result was Ame no Habakiri,

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.860
and then the Nehushtan Armor, and Ichaival, 
which their ally Germany brought them.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.750
And the Gungnir...

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.700
The documents we acquired in Valverde

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.090
were encrypted with a method 
once used by the German army.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:37.250
That's why we need to use the 
decryption devices here.

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:41.130
I can understand why

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.320
you need top-level security around 
the area when using the decryptors.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:50.710
But... I don't understand why you ordered
 the people in this area to evacuate.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.700
What we need to protect isn't 
people, it's the country.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.640
It's not people?

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.780
At least, that's what Kamakura is thinking.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.160
It's a complex, difficult code.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:14.740
It's going to take some time to decrypt.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:15.990
Tsubasa.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.430
After the briefing, Yukine, Tachibana, and I

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.440
will stand by in a nearby 
area to keep watch.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:26.840
Um, what should we do?

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.340
Nine o'clock, nothing.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.790
Twelve o'clock, not—

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.690
Over there! Survivor sighted!

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.650
Let's go!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.220
I can understand why you'd want 
to copy them, but, Kiri-chan...

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.460
You need to get out of here!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.190
Scary! It's not a person at all!

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.170
Scarecrows these days are well made...

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:58.130
Without LiNKER, this is all we can do.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:01.710
For now, we need to patrol
 to make sure there's nobody left!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.770
But you're too tense and it's 
stopping you from doing your best.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:10.150
To be honest, if I'm not doing 
something, I get really worried.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:10.970
Yeah.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:14.380
Okay, back to the mission!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:16.820
Kiri-chan, behind you!

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:24.060
Are you okay?

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.270
I'm so sorry!

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:29.020
No, it was my fault.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:33.020
The government has ordered an evacuation.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.730
You should leave immediately.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:37.340
Oh, right. Right.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:42.740
But it's the end of tomato harvest season.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.620
They look delicious!

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.230
They are delicious!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.350
Try one!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.830
It is delicious!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.740
Try it, Shirabe!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.830
Thank you.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.720
You're right!

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.810
Totally different from the 
neighborhood supermarket!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:10.530
Right? We put a lot of 
effort into raising them.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.760
U-Um, ma'am...

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.940
Found you!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.130
Oh, it's the wrong ones.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.960
It's the unfortunate 
tri-color dango trio, huh?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:25.710
Tri...

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.440
...color?

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.710
What do you mean, "dango"?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.530
Just what you look like.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:32.770
Are you mad?

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:36.900
But there's no fun to be had 
fighting you poor losers.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.840
Or can you use your gears...

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:42.420
If you really want to see them...

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.390
...we'll show you!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.920
Don't let her provoke you!

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.200
We're supposed to be doing our best 
with what we have, right?

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.940
I knew it. You used all your 
medicine and can't fight.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:05.190
Fine, then I'll take you out before 
the traffic lights start flashing!

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:16.510
Alca-Noise signal detected!

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.480
<i>They're at point S-16!</i>

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.430
<i>Approximately fifty detected!</i>

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.970
Roger! I'm on my way!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.990
<i>Leave it to me!</i>

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:27.940
I'm closer!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:36.040
<i>Killter Ichaival Tron.</i>

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:10.400
<i>It's time for the girl whose whole body
 is a weapon, the missile surfer.</i>

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:19.700
<i>The hit girl, giving you kisses with my 
bullets until the very last one runs out</i>

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.730
Maria, go faster!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.650
I can't believe we have to 
run from guys like this!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:27.230
<i>So where's the cherry who wants 
to get shot? Bang Bang Yeah</i>

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:30.460
We're saved! I wish I was like her!

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:32.720
<i>It seems like this world just isn't fair</i>

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.710
You take care of it! Let's go!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:37.680
<i>The enemy says they've got 
their reasons, too, right?</i>

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.890
Chris-chan has arrived.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:37.440
She's entered combat!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:41.860
The alchemists are incredibly dangerous! 
Wait for the others to arrive.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:42.840
<i>But if you're drawing your sword, 
then I'll show no mercy</i>

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:45.100
Looks like... I won't be able to do that!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:46.740
I missed you!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:51.770
<i>I won't let my bullets 
fly any way but straight</i>

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:50.620
The female hormones within 
me are boiling over!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.370
<i>The night when I looked up at the moon 
and realized the past will never change</i>

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:59.980
<i>So if you can't turn back the clock, 
what do you do about tomorrow?</i>

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:05.490
<i>The days when I hid my pain 
and asked that question</i>

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.670
You finally got close to me!

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.530
<i>Aah, and now</i>

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:14.220
<i>someone sings</i>

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.500
You panicked and used your big 
move, and you're wide open!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.220
And it'll cost you your life.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:27.000
Yeah, gotta be careful about 
leaving yourself wide open.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:40.840
The inner three parts and outer 
three parts of my body generate Qi!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.900
This fist is a grand spear 
composed of six parts!

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:46.650
Movies teach you everything 
there is to know!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:50.400
A wall?

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:56.450
A wall? How rude! It's a sword!

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.930
The traffic lights are here!

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:03.020
<i>Your time playing and ignoring 
my orders is at an end!</i>

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:10.850
I'll be bringing my new outfit 
to the next dance party.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:12.750
Look forward to it.

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.190
Bye!

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.900
Thank you.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:24.800
Not at all.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.480
I'll get some water.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:28.700
Wait, Kiri-chan! I'll go with you.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.260
They're so energetic.

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:33.760
Are you hurt, ma'am?

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:35.800
I'm fine.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.800
But you must be tired.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.720
I made trouble for you 
by being so slow to leave.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.690
No...

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:49.820
If we had the power to protect you, 
this wouldn't have happened.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.520
Oh, right.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:57.190
Why don't you take a tomato, too?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.900
I-I don't really like tomatoes...

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.360
Okay, I'll just have a little.

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:15.520
It's sweet.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.450
It's like a fruit!

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:23.190
The trick to raising sweet tomatoes 
is to put them in a harsh environment.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:29.290
If you wait until the last second to give 
them water, they gain a natural sweetness.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:35.140
They don't wilt from the harshness?

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.110
Spoiling them too much is 
what ruins them, actually.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:43.720
A great harvest only exists 
after enduring harshness.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.700
Only after enduring harshness...

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:54.420
I'm sure humans and tomatoes are the same.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.420
The analysis is taking time.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:08.670
Commander, a message from Kamakura.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.630
They came to us directly, huh?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.600
Put them through.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.450
Yes, sir.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:17.570
I'll put him onscreen.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.360
<i>Pathetic.</i>

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:25.730
<i>Not only did you allow the enemy inside a 
sealed area, you failed to defeat them.</i>

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:30.380
You're exactly right, sir. 
We failed. I'm sorry.

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:32.610
<i>The use of the organization's headquarters</i>

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:35.900
<i>was a special measure intended to put 
the United Nations in debt to us.</i>

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:42.420
<i>But we can't put the core of our 
nation's defense in danger for it!</i>

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.590
Of course.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:48.300
<i>You are to drive these barbarians 
from the land of Japan.</i>

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:53.960
He wasn't happy.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:59.390
But, Commander, why did the enemy 
follow us here to Matsushiro?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:05.400
Either they want the Valverde documents, 
or to finish things with the Wielders.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:07.020
Or perhaps...

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.910
Tomosato-san.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.340
I brought you some warm tea.

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:22.080
Yeah!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:24.970
Thanks for the warm tea.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.590
Seems like it's the opposite 
from how it usually is today.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.070
You, too.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.860
Thank you.

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:33.130
Looking into something? Is it going well?

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.020
Is this...?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.300
Yes.

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:44.160
I thought that with us needing the LiNKER 
as soon as possible, it was necessary.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:48.140
Our awful memories...

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.590
Since we couldn't serve as Finé's vessel,

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:56.620
we orphans were used in experiments to 
increase the compatibility numbers.

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:10.590
It's impossible, Mom...

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:15.050
I can't be like Serena...

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:19.010
Maria, you will not be 
allowed to give up here.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:24.010
You decided to carry the burden 
of evil, and stay true to evil.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:26.350
You must endure in spite of the pain.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.520
Mom...

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.770
Multiple Alca-Noise signals!

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:35.090
Near Matsushiro Elementary School 3!

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:37.220
They're heading to the Kazanari 
Organization's headquarters!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.700
That's where we took tomato lady!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.780
Maria!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:41.640
Yeah.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:46.650
No! You don't have any LiNKER!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:47.640
Where are you going?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.100
We'll let the other three handle the enemy.

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.600
We'll evacuate the civilians.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.130
Understood.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.710
Don't do anything reckless.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:56.720
Right.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.050
There're so many...

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:09.100
We can't let them pass!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.900
There's no time! Let's finish this quickly!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.960
Roger!

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.610
Ignite Module!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.080
Draw swords!

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.840
<i>Dáinsleif.</i>

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.240
<i>It's time to fly! (Let's fly!)</i>

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.930
<i>It's time to journey into the sky! 
(Let's fly!)</i>

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.300
<i>To tomorrow!</i>

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:46.450
<i>Bring our voices together as one 
in the greatest symphony of all</i>

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:49.060
<i>Do you have a dream 
(Let's fight!) in your heart</i>

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.070
I've been waiting for those drawn swords.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:52.000
<i>Do you have (Let's fight!) 
a passionate song</i>

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:52.570
The Ignite sure is incredible.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:57.920
<i>Your overflowing heat explodes</i>

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:58.010
And that's why we hold in our 
hands a shining red victory.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:03.290
<i>An infinite soul connecting hand in hand</i>

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.860
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.790
<b>Soaring Phoenix's Slash</b>

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.190
Overlapping wings descend on you!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:13.030
None can stop their flight!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:20.030
My gear?!

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:25.820
Tsubasa-san!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.070
Are those...

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.170
Faust Robes?

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.280
You'll pay for doing that to my senpai!

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.640
This is nothing!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.200
My Ignite...

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.940
Chris-chan!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:42.090
Why is the Ignite...

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:47.930
The Faust Robes of the Lapis Philosophicus.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:53.470
It's known as the deepest secret of
 alchemy, the Philosopher's Stone.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:57.410
To create it, we used the 
information about the construction

00:18:57.410 --> 00:19:00.190
of the world gained through the 
Château de Tiffauges's analysis.

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.660
We took it for our own purposes.

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:09.220
If you're going to use that 
power to make someone suffer,

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.570
I'll...

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.490
Make someone suffer?

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:18.160
Not at all. Our great desire 
is the liberation of humanity.

00:19:18.490 --> 00:19:22.060
To release them from the bonds of control.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.670
The liberation of humanity?

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:28.400
Then tell me the reason.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.540
If it's to help someone,

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:35.360
we can work together...

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:37.490
Work together?

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:40.480
Saint Germain, hurry up.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.330
That light!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.460
The excitement is coming!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:01.310
Controlling Director Adam Weishaupt!

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.790
Why are you here?

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.520
What are you trying to show us?

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:13.320
I'm transmuting gold. What else?

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:18.110
We're alchemists, after all!

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.870
What's going on?

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.190
Hurry and find out!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:28.750
Is he using alchemy to cause nuclear 
fusion at normal temperatures?

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.610
Not only has a new enemy appeared,

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.380
but I'm seeing signals from 
the Airgetlám, Shul Shagana,

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.240
and Igalima at the combat point!

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.130
Maria-san and the others!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.710
<i>A voice echoes, where does it come from?</i>

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:43.710
<i>It's telling me to rise up</i>

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.980
<i>My heart is pounding, when did it start?</i>

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:51.470
They're not using the LiNKER! 
The stress will rip their bodies apart!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.090
<i>Hold your courage up high</i>

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:55.500
<i>And now head for tomorrow!</i>

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:58.480
Let's get out of here before we're caught up
 in the director's Golden Transmutation!

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:04.010
The estimated destructive power 
of the energy is over ten megatons,

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:05.540
and it's continuing to expand!

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.780
It's Tunguska-class?!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:14.030
<i>I wanted to believe in them more than me</i>

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.300
<i>It's hard to do it right</i>

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:24.820
<i>Let's follow the one who taught us 
so much and cut away our weakness!</i>

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:30.180
Even if our bodies break!

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:02.140
This tiny amount?

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:05.850
Life is cheap, huh?
